	quest.00885F75F7780A5F.title: "Kill all the Vanilla bosses"
	quest.0153B2FDA75D5D7F.quest_desc: ["Found in groups of 3 inside of their underwater temple, these fish-like creature will use their magic on you to prevent you from breaking blocks in their home. Defeat them to stop the curse."]
	quest.0206507E91CB74CB.quest_desc: ["The Shriving Stone can be used to remove upgrade orbs and infused spells from equipment."]
	quest.029B159A66AA5726.quest_desc: ["with time you learned how to cause sculk to grow in a basin using the &esculk goop&r, &esculk flour&r and &eliquid experience&r."]
	quest.029B159A66AA5726.quest_subtitle: "why does it move like that"
	quest.042A3458AD19791F.quest_desc: ["In slaying mobs, you collect their essence. By crafting essence into seeds, you can grow more essence. This will be very important later."]
	quest.042A3458AD19791F.quest_subtitle: "The first step towards *almost* vegan meat"
	quest.042A3458AD19791F.title: "Grow a Mob™"
	quest.051B0A164495B3F3.quest_desc: [
		"In your time on this world, your body has accumulated some natural magic! However, it is not usable in this state."
		""
		"By standing in an &9Alchemist Cauldron&r you are able to collect your &4blood,&r which you can use for crafting in the future."
	]
	quest.051B0A164495B3F3.quest_subtitle: "Try not to die fj"
	quest.05EF55137BA484BA.quest_desc: ["The &dBlaze Enchanter&r allows you to get new enchantments, much like an enchanting table. However, it can go up to 60 levels when &l&bSuper-Enchanted.&r &7&o(we will get there soon)."]
	quest.05EF55137BA484BA.title: "Getting Enchantment"
	quest.0810F45BBF076982.title: "Kill all of the Cataclysm Bosses"
	quest.0819B8A983F38919.quest_desc: ["Portal Frames can be used to create permanant portals between 2 points using the portal spell."]
	quest.081D11F3734AC611.quest_desc: [
		"By placing &ePedestals and Gold Dust&r on the ground, in a circle around a sapling, you will be able to perform the &eRitual of the Forest&r to bring new items into this world. "
		""
		"&7(note: see The Book of Natural Aura for the information about how to make the multiblock)&r"
	]
	quest.081D11F3734AC611.quest_subtitle: "tree magic (tragic)"
	quest.081D11F3734AC611.title: "Ritual of the forest"
	quest.08B4A79FF8D519F7.title: "Kill all the Bosses"
	quest.08E39BAF5F76D58B.quest_desc: ["As you are looking at that &eNebulite&r you just got you realise that this is the catalyst for higher level magic, if you put one in the basin with your &eimperium essence&r you might be able to get stronger essence."]
	quest.08E39BAF5F76D58B.quest_subtitle: "no your not done with that yet"
	quest.09DC56C444A511A5.quest_desc: ["&zYummy Ink"]
	quest.09DFC797AB6C31F8.quest_desc: [
		"Aura isn't infinite. Once you use the aura in an area, &nit is gone for good.&r That is why you need to replenish it."
		""
		"&dAncient tree leaves&r allow aura to stay at a balanced level. There are many other way to create, and even overload an aura in an area."
		""
		"Be aware that &baura imbalance will have environmental effects.&r Not enough, and nature will start to decay around you. Too much, and it will flourish, pushing plants grow faster, or even changing stone to ores."
		""
		"Refer to the &2Book of Natural Aura&r for more information."
	]
	quest.09DFC797AB6C31F8.quest_subtitle: "you're in debt now"
	quest.09DFC797AB6C31F8.title: "Aura Farming"
	quest.0AF1129BECF57D26.quest_desc: [
		"In your travels you may have come across &echurches and clerics,&r capable of spellcasting. That magic has to come from somewhere right? What would happen if you tried to contact their \"higher beings\" yourself, requesting more power from them? "
		""
		"First, you need to bring their attention to your offerings. Perhaps &ea Corrupted Diamond&r from the energy of this new dimension might be just what you need."
	]
	quest.0AF1129BECF57D26.quest_subtitle: "even on nights and weekends"
	quest.0AF1129BECF57D26.title: "Calling on the Gods"
	quest.0B5885B78D3E0D62.quest_desc: ["the Dead King can be either found in the overworld, lurking in his &7underground dungeon,&r or he can be summoned using a spell scroll. &8(Note: his summoned form is more powerful than his in-world form.)"]
	quest.0C414253FB655759.quest_desc: ["as you hold &ethe goop&r in your hand, you feel the pure evil inside of it you figure that by compacting it again you would be able to get pure &eevil essence&r"]
	quest.0C414253FB655759.quest_subtitle: "why is it kinda cute"
	quest.0F768BCD71A54171.title: "Uncommon Ink"
	quest.10877FCE749BF5EB.quest_desc: [
		"In your exploration, you have likely found some &espell scrolls&r. They are great, however they are not reusable. By putting them in a &eSpellbook,&r spells become reusable. "
		""
		"&7(Note: by looking&r &2#curios:spellbook&r &7in EMI, you can see all the spellbooks avalable)&r"
	]
	quest.10877FCE749BF5EB.quest_subtitle: "More than one time use"
	quest.10877FCE749BF5EB.title: "My First Spellbook"
	quest.12301966C31B39B7.quest_desc: [
		"Hidden at the bottom of it's ruined citadel, &dThe Ender Guardian&r is there, waiting for something..."
		""
		"The Ender Guardian can be resummoned using the &eEye of the Void.&r"
	]
	quest.12301966C31B39B7.title: "Kill the Ender Guardian"
	quest.129700DFDF9936B5.quest_desc: [
		"Magic coins have been added for smps to have a usable currency."
		""
		"If you are playing solo, feel free to remove the mod or ignore it."
	]
	quest.129700DFDF9936B5.quest_subtitle: "For SMP purposes!"
	quest.14E8174303C75142.quest_desc: [
		"After triggering a naturally-generated sculk shrieker 3 times, the Warden will emerge from the ground to hunt you. "
		""
		"&lGood luck! You will need it."
	]
	quest.1B59D4E6C87FD4D2.quest_desc: [
		"&9Runestone Fragments&r can be collected by breaking &9Runestone slag&r found in the world. "
		""
		"Runestone Fragments are the component of runes. You may not need a lot of them right now, but you will need plenty in the future if you want to reach your full potential."
	]
	quest.1B59D4E6C87FD4D2.quest_subtitle: "you're gonna need a lot of those"
	quest.1B59D4E6C87FD4D2.title: "Rune Magic"
	quest.1BBEBBEF28E330ED.quest_desc: [
		"The ruined book is the basis for all the higher level spellbook, it can be found in ancient city chest and has a 10% chance to drop from the Warden"
		""
		"tip: look up &a#spellbooks&r in EMI"
	]
	quest.1C44B8037EC5B3BB.quest_desc: ["Congratulations on getting &2Experience Nuggets&r! To use them for enchanting, we must turn it into&a Liquid Experience.&r"]
	quest.1C44B8037EC5B3BB.title: "Freshly Squezed Experience "
	quest.1EB48D2B519C751D.quest_desc: [
		"&eIgnis&r can be summoned by using a &6Burning Ember&r at the altar in the top of it's Nether Temple/Fortress."
		""
		"To find the temple, you can use the &eEye of Flame&r"
	]
	quest.1EB48D2B519C751D.title: "Kill Ignis"
	quest.20DFD2DE5311DBCB.quest_desc: [
		"You finally arrive in The End, home of the &0&lPrimordial Void.&r Unfortunately for you, the &5Ender Dragon&r is guarding the exit, alongside an egg that will never hatch."
		""
		"The only way you can get out of here alive is to kill her. "
	]
	quest.20DFD2DE5311DBCB.quest_subtitle: "And the Abyss looked back"
	quest.2161F4D5545404C0.quest_desc: ["By infusing a &eMundane Potion&r with an &eEcho Shard,&r you obtain a &7temporally disturbed liquid.&r It's like it's always, yet never, been present. You can use it for some upgrades, or to accelerate the growth of amethyst."]
	quest.2161F4D5545404C0.quest_subtitle: "time machine fuel"
	quest.22101AE190B2DF30.quest_desc: [
		"In exploring this new dimension, you may spot a red castle in the distance, and notice a fire elemental that is clearly in need of a job."
		""
		"By crafting a &mcage&r &o&eWell Furnished Office&r you are able to &mcapture&r &o&6Employ&r these creatures in your quest for power."
	]
	quest.22101AE190B2DF30.quest_subtitle: "They want be be in there I swear"
	quest.22101AE190B2DF30.title: "9 to 5"
	quest.226A102EC973A243.quest_desc: [
		"With your &bCrystal&r now fully attuned to the overworld, &oyou can sense your next goal.&r The path to total control of The Overworld is through &cThe Underworld&r, as the &4&n&lPrimordial Evils&r&r&r have less control over the Nether. "
		""
		"By drawing power from &cThe Underworld&r, you may be able to grow stronger."
	]
	quest.226A102EC973A243.quest_subtitle: "Getting an upgrade"
	quest.226A102EC973A243.title: "Enhancing your Crystal"
	quest.2429465315F14127.quest_desc: [
		"Press \"K\" to open the skill tree menu in the following skill trees"
		""
		"&e&l-Presence:&r&r &bGet points by being present in the world. 1 hour of activity gives 1 skill point. It is the only way to get forceloadable chunks.&r"
		""
		"&e&l-Bosses:&r&r &bGet points by killing bosses and claiming their rewards within the questbook.&r"
		""
		"&e&l-Magic:&r&r &bGet points by casting spells! There are 4 different magic trees that you can unlock by progressing through them.&r"
	]
	quest.2429465315F14127.quest_subtitle: "No, the create saw can't cut this one."
	quest.24EECF89A54059C0.quest_desc: [
		"By melting and recombining essence, you can craft purer, more potent essences."
		""
		"&aEssences serve 2 main functions.&r "
		"&eFirst    - &bit is used to craft your own magic ink for spell crafting. "
		"&eSecond - &d it can be used to make Mob Essence Seeds, to grow and collect mob drops without having to fight them."
	]
	quest.24EECF89A54059C0.quest_subtitle: "the essence of magic"
	quest.263E7BD96AA04346.quest_desc: [
		"This pack changes access to The Nether and The End by locking it behind pack progression. "
		"By the end of &cChapter 1,&r you should be able to enter &cThe Nether,&r while &5Chapter 2&r should allow access to &5The End. &r"
	]
	quest.263E7BD96AA04346.quest_subtitle: "Pace yourself!"
	quest.263E7BD96AA04346.title: "Dimensional Travel"
	quest.28F5D179DF71F025.quest_desc: [
		"By spouting timeless slurry above a regular amethyst block, you are able to accelerate the growth of amethyst crystals."
		""
		"&7(Note: you need 4 bottle in the spout, and &nthe slurry is not consumed by the operation)&r"
	]
	quest.2A835E11C15CC9A5.quest_desc: [
		"Sleeping in it's lair in the Nether, this Netherite Monstrosity can be found using the &eEye of the Monstrous&r. The monster will awaken once you are in front of it."
		""
		"Once the boss has been defeated, it can be resummoned using the &eEye of Monstrous&r"
	]
	quest.2A835E11C15CC9A5.title: "Kill the Netherite Monstrosity"
	quest.2C1DEB9B05665B25.quest_desc: [
		"Laying at the bottom of his pyramid, &eThe Ancient Remenent&r needs to be awoken first before it can be hurt. For that, you will need to find the &6Necklace of the Desert&r inside of the pyramid &7(tip: check for the suspicius sand)&r"
		""
		"Once the boss has been defeated, it can be resummoned using the &6Eye of Desert,&r and doesn't need the necklace to be awoken."
	]
	quest.2C1DEB9B05665B25.title: "Kill the Ancient Remnant"
	quest.2DCA55C74D061B81.quest_desc: ["In examining &eZenelite,&r you realize that it's &z&oabsorbing the surrounding aura.&r What might happen if you were to put in on your &2natural altar&r?"]
	quest.2DCA55C74D061B81.quest_subtitle: "how much potential can one thing have"
	quest.2E0BD94A45E561BB.quest_desc: [
		"By placing the &eTransmutation Catalyst&r on top of the golden bricks in your Natural Altar, you can expand the range of recipes on the altar. "
		""
		"This will allow you to push your &bCrystal&r to stronger, more potent sources of magic."
	]
	quest.2E0BD94A45E561BB.quest_subtitle: "still cant make gold :("
	quest.2E0BD94A45E561BB.title: "Real Alchemy"
	quest.2E234E360FE8BE52.quest_desc: [
		"By sacrificing this cruel, powerful abomination to the Gods, they are fearful and hesitant of you, and grant as much power as they can. It seems they're unwilling to see any further crimes against nature."
		""
		"It is time to go take care of the remaning &4&n&lPrimordial Evils.&r"
	]
	quest.2E234E360FE8BE52.quest_subtitle: "UNLIMITED POWER"
	quest.2E234E360FE8BE52.title: "The Ultimate Crystal"
	quest.2F07F360CFBF3801.quest_desc: [
		"This pack contains &dEnd Remastered&r, which requires 12 different ender eyes to open the end portal. "
		""
		"Most eyes found in structures have been given recipes, but they will still spawn in their usual loot chests."
	]
	quest.2F5A1A24E6CBB746.quest_desc: [
		"While feeding your new friend, you notice that they tend to burn a little bit more when fed lava. Maybe, by making a cake out of it, they could burn even hotter?"
		""
		"By combinig an egg, sugar, and the crushed soil of it's homeworld, you will have the perfect base for your cake."
	]
	quest.2F5A1A24E6CBB746.quest_subtitle: "And they might sell like some"
	quest.2F5A1A24E6CBB746.title: "Hot Cakes"
	quest.2FC16E2335FC3447.quest_desc: [
		"While delving into the &2Book of Natural Aura,&r you notice an old ritual that could alow you to contact the Gods. An &eoffering table&r surounded by a &ecircle of flower&r would let you comune with the Gods."
		""
		"By placing your &eoffering&r in the bowl, and throwing your &espirit of calling on the bowl&r, you might just get what you ask for."
	]
	quest.2FC16E2335FC3447.quest_subtitle: "the powers that be"
	quest.2FFB0DF1C8A93D3F.quest_desc: ["After looking around an Ancient City, you find a few &eEcho Shards&r. To any mortal this would be an other useless relic, but not to you. No, you see this as it really is, &o&za source of limitless mystical power."]
	quest.2FFB0DF1C8A93D3F.quest_subtitle: "Hidden Power"
	quest.2FFB0DF1C8A93D3F.title: "A Shard of the Beyond"
	quest.33778C9075984117.quest_desc: ["As seen in old paintings, the Wither can be summoned using &eSoul Sand&r and &eWither Skeleton Skulls&r. It doesn't like to be summoned and will break the blocks in it's way! Try not to do it in your base."]
	quest.35CD80B054A764F4.quest_desc: [
		"Printers can be used to copy &5Enchanted Books,&r allowing you to duplicate enchantments! Goodbye, villagers!"
		""
		"&7(Note: books can be combined on the blaze forger using super exp to get over-level enchanted books)"
	]
	quest.35CD80B054A764F4.title: "Duplicating Enchanted Books "
	quest.36462854FEB3836B.quest_desc: [
		"When fed to a &dBlaze Enchanter&r or a &6Blaze Forger,&r the Cake o' Enchanting allows the enchantment to &bbreak the vanilla level cap on enchantments by 1.&r "
		""
		"They also allow &o&3conflicting enchantments&r to be applied to gear. Please refer to the ponders for both Blazes for more information. "
		""
		"&7(Note: once fed, the blazes only consume the super experience, and not the regular experience!)&r"
	]
	quest.36462854FEB3836B.title: "Super Enchanting"
	quest.36AC6B9FA997483D.quest_subtitle: "I'm blue now!"
	quest.3AFA501E2140A92E.quest_desc: [
		"The last of it's kind, stationed at the exit of The End "
		""
		"&8tip: Killing the dragon will drop an egg and a head every time."
		""
		"The dragon can be respawned using end crystals&r"
	]
	quest.3AFA501E2140A92E.title: "Kill the Ender Dragon"
	quest.3C057D4ACFD7901A.quest_desc: [
		"&9The shadow scale&r was a step in the right direction, but you feel that it can still host more magic somehow."
		""
		"Perhaps, by giving it &ePure Experience and Epic Ink,&r you might be able to elevate it to another level."
	]
	quest.3C057D4ACFD7901A.quest_subtitle: "more, more always more"
	quest.3C057D4ACFD7901A.title: "A New Metal"
	quest.3C8C1AC9DB1E7413.quest_subtitle: "Rinse-and-repeat for better essence and ink"
	quest.3C9B4151037F8D8B.quest_desc: ["Cataclysm Bosses have been adjusted with &l&clate game&r in mind. Make sure to gear up a LOT before you go fight them!"]
	quest.3E6E9C53FBE836FB.quest_desc: ["The scroll forge is used to create new spell scrolls using &9magical ink&r and a &dmagical catalyst,&r check EMI for each catalyst to use for each school."]
	quest.40D20DF06C9E9DE6.quest_desc: ["Well... it is to be expected &ethat &othing...&r&r needs to be contained. Good thing you made a cage!"]
	quest.40D20DF06C9E9DE6.quest_subtitle: "It might have been a mistake"
	quest.415E7088C2B70B3A.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to a new and magical Braincells experience! First of all, thank you for downloading this pack, and we hope that you will have as much fun playing it has we have had making it."
		""
		"&eYour goal in this world (if you want a goal) is to defeat all the  &r&4&l&nPrimordial Evils&r &eof this world, and to restore the magic within yourself.&r "
		""
		"To do so, you must craft yourself a &l&bCrystal,&r&r and grow it to it's full potential - if you wish to prevail!"
	]
	quest.415E7088C2B70B3A.quest_subtitle: "Seventh of it's name"
	quest.415E7088C2B70B3A.title: "Welcome to Braincells: Magical Creation"
	quest.44755A583005696C.quest_desc: ["there might be a way to turn &eNebulite&r into &eDiamond&r using the power of the sea."]
	quest.44755A583005696C.quest_subtitle: "this might be a downgrade idk"
	quest.44755A583005696C.title: "Infinite diamond"
	quest.45CB38859AE7EC6A.quest_desc: [
		"You would believe that something shooting fireballs at you is a sign that they don't want your job, but it's just the &6Blaze&r way to show initiative."
		""
		""
		"By interacting with either a &6Blaze&r or a &6Blaze spawner&r you can put a &6Blaze&r in your &6Blaze Burner&r"
	]
	quest.45CB38859AE7EC6A.quest_subtitle: "If you're cold, they're cold. Feed them."
	quest.45CB38859AE7EC6A.title: "Finally some heat"
	quest.487E604279EB7326.quest_desc: [
		"By studying the head of the dragon, you notice that it is still able to produce it's dangerous breath. &dYou need only blow air behind it&r &9and - &ovoila! &r&5Dragon's breath processing!&r"
		""
		"Using this new-found knowlege, you can process &eShadowline Ingots&r into a new material."
	]
	quest.487E604279EB7326.quest_subtitle: "you couldn't just let her be dead did you"
	quest.49D021320B5479E2.title: "Rare Ink"
	quest.4A905C23B855B8C3.quest_desc: ["Before you can use Eldritch spells, you will need to \"learn\" the spell by using ancient manuscript. You will then be able to craft scroll."]
	quest.4ACD5E1C7AB3B241.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you have the base of your cake, you can fill it with lava and feed it to your Blaze, &l&bSuperheating&r them."
		""
		"&7(Note: you will probably want to automate these)&r"
	]
	quest.4ACD5E1C7AB3B241.quest_subtitle: "why didn't I think of that first"
	quest.4ACD5E1C7AB3B241.title: "Lava Cake"
	quest.4CA7429F037343E1.quest_desc: [
		"Sophisticated Backpacks are back!!!"
		"&o&3...however, they have been heavily nerfed;"
		""
		"&e- You will get slowness debuff for every &oadditional&r&e backpack you carry after the first in your inventory.&r"
		""
		"&e- Many upgrades have been removed to prevent automation through backpacks.&r"
		""
		"&e- Backpacks can only have 1 stack upgrade at a time.&r"
		""
		"&e- You can't put create contraptions in them.&r"
	]
	quest.4CA7429F037343E1.quest_subtitle: "but at what cost..."
	quest.4CFDD24356D1527A.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you have settled in this world, it's time to make it your own. However, you can feel the dark, unsettling power of the &l&4&nPrimordial Evils&r&r&r siphoning the magic of this world. To reach your full potential, you will need to get a &bMagic Crystal&r to be able to reclaim some of the magic for yourself."
		""
		"The first step of your journey is to fabricate machines that can construct the crystal. &eAndesite alloy&r will be a great starting resource for your quest."
	]
	quest.4CFDD24356D1527A.quest_subtitle: "Putting the tech in Arcanotech!"
	quest.4CFDD24356D1527A.title: "The Andesite Age"
	quest.53C9B66BEC667ED0.quest_desc: ["This chapter is an overview of the Iron's Spells and Spellbooks mod, and is meant to guide you through the mod's main progression."]
	quest.53C9B66BEC667ED0.title: "Iron's Spells and Spellbooks"
	quest.567987BD8B2D09D0.quest_desc: ["Crushing sculk gives you back some sort of flour like substance, you wonder what would a cake made with this would taste like."]
	quest.567987BD8B2D09D0.quest_subtitle: "Food for your sculk"
	quest.57569BBF1C2757C2.quest_desc: [
		"&5The Leviathan&r can be summoned from the depths of its underwater temple by presenting a &eAbysal Sacrifice&r, at the altar in the heart of the temple."
		""
		"To find the temple you can use the &eEye of the Abyss&r"
	]
	quest.57569BBF1C2757C2.title: "Kill the Leviathan"
	quest.582F9991977D5F8B.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you have your &bFirst Crystal,&r you can feel your attunement to this dimension grow. You can feel the pull of &4The Underworld&r, but you're not yet ready to go there &oquite&r yet. "
		""
		"First, you must enhance your &bCrystal&r to withstand interdimensional travel. By using the &eNatural Altar&r you are able to pull pure nature enrgy from your surounding to conver item, but be warned using too much aura have concequences"
	]
	quest.582F9991977D5F8B.quest_subtitle: "Using the full spectrum of nature magic"
	quest.582F9991977D5F8B.title: "Harnessing Aura"
	quest.58F0BBF91AF527E2.title: "Kill all Iron's Spellbooks Bosses"
	quest.5A26FA4B0BB3A80C.quest_desc: [
		"The &aEnchanting Template&r can be used after an item on the &6Blaze Forger&r to remove an enchantment from the item, and apply it to the template. "
		""
		"Templates can then be &3reused&r to apply enchantments on items, like an enchanted book, with the &6Blaze Forger&r"
	]
	quest.5A26FA4B0BB3A80C.title: "Removing and Reusing Enchantments"
	quest.5AC2C75CFBAF6550.quest_desc: [
		"Somewhere over the ocean stands the &bAcropolis&r, at the top of the tower is &3Scylla, The Howling Storm&r."
		""
		"Once the boss has been defeated, it can be resummoned using the &eEye of Storm&r"
	]
	quest.5AC2C75CFBAF6550.title: "Kill Scylla"
	quest.5C08CB0D34C33574.quest_desc: [
		"By applying the &6&rBrilliant Fiber&r to the leaves of a tree, they will slowly start converting and spreading to nearby leaves. break those leaves you will get &eGold Leaves&r."
		""
		"&7(Note: the conversion takes time! Wait untill it start spreading before breaking it)&r"
	]
	quest.5C08CB0D34C33574.quest_subtitle: "not the edible one"
	quest.5C62263B16BA7F48.quest_desc: ["&6Tyros, the First Flamebearer&r can be summoned using a &eCinderus Soulcaller&r in the dome at the top of his Nether Fortress"]
	quest.5C62263B16BA7F48.title: "Tyros, The First Flamebearer"
	quest.5D396C4C7D658B6B.quest_desc: [
		"This &9new liquid&r looks like the perfect thing you could use to upgrade &ezenalite&r. "
		""
		"By combining the two, you manage to get a hold of the strongest alloy you have ever seen."
	]
	quest.5D396C4C7D658B6B.quest_subtitle: "Ea-nāṣir wishes he could sell this"
	quest.5E59E1F0630F52AE.quest_desc: [
		"Emprisoned at the heart of the frozen citadel, &3Maledictus the Eternal Cold&r is waiting for a worthy challenger."
		""
		"Once the boss has been defeated, it can be resummoned using the &eEye of Curse.&r"
	]
	quest.5E59E1F0630F52AE.title: "Kill Maledictus"
	quest.5F22178B2B9F58E6.quest_desc: [
		"One of the component you can get from &eEnd Stone&r is &eshard of nebulite&r a gemstone of great magical potential, it can be used to provoke magical reaction perfect to bring your essence to the next level."
		""
		"&eNebulite&r is pretty rare about 1 in 200 &eEnd Stone&r will give you a shard, you need 4 shards to make 1 Nebulite."
	]
	quest.5F22178B2B9F58E6.quest_subtitle: "the diamond of the end"
	quest.5F22178B2B9F58E6.title: "Your first magical catalyst"
	quest.61CE19D7C280227C.quest_desc: [
		"Using the &eEye of Mech&r you will find the ancient factory buried by time in The Overworld. At it's heart, you will find the Harbinger - a mechanical creation of the ancient times, built in the Wither's image. "
		""
		"&2To first awaken it, you will need to give it a Nether Star."
		""
		"Once the boss has been defeated, it can be resummoned using the &eEye of Mech&r"
	]
	quest.61CE19D7C280227C.title: "Kill the Harbinger"
	quest.64BB2C9295BC7F40.quest_desc: [
		"Thanks to your new shining &bCrystal,&r the aura around you has become so dense that you are able to &ebottle it up.&r"
		""
		"The result seems to be different depending on the dimension you're in. Test and see what resources you get!"
	]
	quest.64BB2C9295BC7F40.quest_subtitle: "did you know you can just open these"
	quest.64BB2C9295BC7F40.title: "Botteling Aura"
	quest.66672CDE590FC962.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Blaze Forger&r allows you to combine enchantments and weapons, much like an Anvil. However, the forger has &eno repair cost,&r and uses &aLiquid Experience.&r"
		""
		"&7(Note: super-enchanted Blaze Forgers can apply conflicting enchantments to items, such as multiple protection or sharpness enchants.)"
	]
	quest.66672CDE590FC962.title: "Combining Enchantments"
	quest.66D142E68F326B68.quest_desc: [
		"Up until now, every time you saw magical energy going from one thing to an other it always came from a non living things. "
		""
		"This is the exception. "
		"&9Sculk is able to spread by pulling energy from the living. &nThere might be a way make it make more in your factory.&r"
		""
		"Better get some before leaving. "
	]
	quest.66D142E68F326B68.quest_subtitle: "I know you want to"
	quest.66D142E68F326B68.title: "Spread the Sculk"
	quest.67CB849814E816E8.quest_desc: ["Through your exploration, you have found &egold&r, the basic element of magic. By mixing it with &agrass&r and &2leaves,&r you can get &6Brilliant Fiber,&r the key ingredient for &eGolden Leaves&r."]
	quest.67CB849814E816E8.quest_subtitle: "but only for leaves"
	quest.67CB849814E816E8.title: "Midas Touch"
	quest.6978CDC3C48C07E3.quest_desc: ["Using some of that new alloy, it might be best to make a cage. You are working with the unknown, after all. "]
	quest.6978CDC3C48C07E3.quest_subtitle: "just in case"
	quest.69E748108E3466DA.quest_desc: [
		"As the Dragon takes the last breath of it's kind, you take her head and egg. You can finally take it all in, &0the silence&r, &0the darkness&r, &0the &oemptiness&r of it all."
		""
		"The first thing that comes to mind is how thin the magic feels here. Is this really where your quest for magic took you? There has to be something more."
		""
		"&7(Note: the dragon is set to always drop it's head and an egg on death)&r"
	]
	quest.69E748108E3466DA.quest_subtitle: "D:"
	quest.69E748108E3466DA.title: "Kill the Ender Dragon"
	quest.69EC6F0F37FBD30D.quest_desc: [
		"It strikes you as you examine the stones underneath, &5&lthe entire ground is just solidified aura.&r Island-sized clumps of solidified aura."
		""
		"Maybe there is something to get from &ecrushing it.&r"
	]
	quest.69EC6F0F37FBD30D.quest_subtitle: "Could it be?"
	quest.69EC6F0F37FBD30D.title: "Solid Magic"
	quest.6A65498E4F06DA68.quest_desc: [
		"Tired of managing entity lag in your factory? Us too. "
		""
		"Introducing.... &eCrushing Infested Stone!&r Simply drop Infested Stone into crushing wheels, and you'll get &2EXP!&r"
	]
	quest.6A65498E4F06DA68.title: "Get Infested Stone"
	quest.6BB5D77AD11ADB7F.quest_desc: ["By this point you should have an understanding of how the mod works, check &e@hazennstuff&r in EMI for armor and weapons with better stats boost your power."]
	quest.6C7A8AB7495C05B4.quest_desc: ["With enough heat, you can melt Echo Shards into Molten Echo. &9It seems to have multiple applications."]
	quest.6C7A8AB7495C05B4.quest_subtitle: "you can hear the screams in your pipes"
	quest.6C834D08CCB978A5.quest_desc: [
		"Having collected everything you needed, it is time to power your crystal to the next level."
		""
		"By applying the &eSun Core, the Rare Ink, and an upgrade orb&r to your crystal, it is finally strong enough to pierce the barrier between you, and &0The Void.&r "
		""
		"For many, this would normally be the end of their story. For you, however, there is simply more you can do to achieve &4POWER&r."
	]
	quest.6C834D08CCB978A5.quest_subtitle: "Clavis ad Nihilum"
	quest.6C834D08CCB978A5.title: "Crystallum Infernale"
	quest.6F2CC3916932FF85.quest_desc: [
		"By performing the &2Ritual of the Forest,&r you are now able to bring your first &bCrystal&r into this world!"
		""
		"&7(Note: you can only have one&r &bCrystal&r &7equipped at a time in your curio slot)&r"
	]
	quest.6F2CC3916932FF85.quest_subtitle: "The key to high level magic"
	quest.6F2CC3916932FF85.title: "Crafting your first Crystal"
	quest.6F4E0EBB6B5B344F.quest_desc: [
		"As you enter this new dimension, you are struck with the &6blasting heat&r and the &coverwhelming smell of brimstone,&r whilst your eyes adjust to the &eblinding flames and magma.&r"
		""
		"You can sense it. The magic in this realm is raw and unpredictable, but &ooh so powerful. &r"
	]
	quest.6F4E0EBB6B5B344F.quest_subtitle: "Insert Jack Black \"I am steve\" joke"
	quest.71132E78A0BE25FB.quest_desc: [
		"Using a &eSpell Forge,&r you can craft your own spells! By using &5magical ink, paper, and an arcane focus&r you will be able to obtain a brand new spell scroll."
		""
		"The &eArcane Anvil&r, is used to upgrade spell scrolls with better ink, as well as magical equipment with the right material."
	]
	quest.71132E78A0BE25FB.quest_subtitle: "The Wizard's Tools"
	quest.71132E78A0BE25FB.title: "Getting started making magic"
	quest.7120401D1E7BF570.quest_desc: [
		"By heating and compressing the infection, you obtain &eSculk Goop&r, and it shows sign of being able to regrow into full blocks."
		""
		"&7&owhy does it feel both wet and not wet at the same time&r"
	]
	quest.7120401D1E7BF570.quest_subtitle: "THE GOOP'S BACK ON THE MENU BOYZ"
	quest.7120401D1E7BF570.title: "Goop"
	quest.730C1938B2D16CEF.quest_desc: [
		"It might not be the strongest metal, but it's magical potential is nearly limitless."
		""
		"...though, with a little bit of effort, you can get this metal to be one of the strongest materials known to man!"
	]
	quest.730C1938B2D16CEF.quest_subtitle: "Unfortunately not shadow steel!"
	quest.730C1938B2D16CEF.title: "Ingot of Shadow"
	quest.74370B84A072E947.quest_desc: [
		"The Arcane Anvil can be used to upgrade spell scrolls to higher level using&9 magical ink.&r"
		""
		"It can also be used to slot upgrade orbs in compatible armors and weapons! You can slot a maximum of 3 orbs per equipment piece. "
	]
	quest.75432080450DB2BC.quest_desc: ["Hidden away in the &4Nether Wastes,&r &eSolar Core&r remains. Surely this, a remnant of the creation of our Sun and world, will draw the attention of some higher powers. "]
	quest.75432080450DB2BC.quest_subtitle: "\"The power of the Sun, in the palm of your hand...\""
	quest.75432080450DB2BC.title: "The Sun Core"
	quest.76300F95D00CA4E3.quest_desc: ["In exploring this new dimension, you find the cities that tower into the sky. Perhaps they contain a tool to help you fly?"]
	quest.76300F95D00CA4E3.quest_subtitle: "The city at the end of the game"
	quest.797DEB7C981ECFF7.quest_desc: ["using that &esupremium essence&r you are now able to bring your ink to a near perfect state furthering your power over the arcane"]
	quest.797DEB7C981ECFF7.quest_subtitle: "almost perfect"
	quest.7AC2D200691805AF.quest_desc: [
		"Ever since you created that &eStarkissed Zenalite,&r your &bCrystal&r has been trying to fuse with it - yet it doesn't seem to work."
		""
		"To bring your crystal to it's final stage, start by finding a &n&l&#174054source of the Eldritch&r in this world."
	]
	quest.7AC2D200691805AF.quest_subtitle: "&kHorror Beyond Comprention"
	quest.7AC2D200691805AF.title: "The First Point of Contact"
	quest.7C61FB1A4BAAFFF5.quest_desc: [
		"You need one last sacrifice in order to fully grow your &bCrystal.&r To truly gain the favor of the Gods, you figure admiration is the key. "
		""
		"You must create a form of sentient life yourself."
	]
	quest.7C61FB1A4BAAFFF5.quest_subtitle: "what could go wrong"
	quest.7D283BD3317A7E3B.quest_desc: ["By taking mixing equal parts of &6Copper&r and &#A9FFE0Zinc&r you can alloy &#FFCB21Brass&r to upgrade your machines."]
	quest.7D283BD3317A7E3B.quest_subtitle: "The good stuff"
	quest.7D283BD3317A7E3B.title: "The Brass Age"
	quest.7D5B0D57A01C76C1.quest_desc: ["By melting some of that &anew essence&r with &1ink sacs&r and &3water,&r you can now start making your own &5magical ink&r to craft spells without having to find them in the wild."]
	quest.7D5B0D57A01C76C1.title: "Common Ink"
